{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "ogg-pages",
  "gate": "required",
  "operation": "ogg-pages",
  "candidate": "codec-views-worker",
  "worker_operation": "ogg-pages-",
  "contract": [
    "Read every Ogg page of the fixed bitexact remux from the first capture pattern. Rebuild the page with its original flags, granule, serial, sequence, lacing and body. The reference demuxes and writes the same input with the bitexact Ogg muxer in memory. A failed remux emits a refusal record.",
    "For each page fold kind 3 with version, flags, signed granule as a uint64 word, serial, sequence, CRC word, CRC validity, lacing count and lacing bytes. Fold kind 1 with complete page length and the written bytes. A truncated or malformed header or body folds kind 8.",
    "The wire controls compare parsing and writing against the RFC 3533 section 6 page layout and independent polynomial CRC. They include all flag combinations, a full 255-segment page, empty packets and missing granules. The first remux bytes of the muxer's three unstable outputs and the original input of its Skeleton refusal also have wire controls."
  ],
  "required_profiles": [
    "reference-refusal",
    "remux",
    "wire"
  ],
  "required_targets": [
    "aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu",
    "thumbv7neon-unknown-linux-gnueabihf"
  ],
  "iterations": 20,
  "minimum_pairs": 30,
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "runner": "cargo xtask report",
  "reference": "ffmpeg-codec-views-native",
